  leg_press: ['Quads lead, with glutes assisting.', 'Sit in the machine with your back flat and feet shoulder-width apart on the platform.|Release the safeties and lower the platform with control until your knees reach about 90 degrees.|Press the platform away without locking your knees.|Return slowly with a controlled tempo.', 'Keep your lower back and hips on the seat.|Higher foot placement shifts work to glutes.', 'Letting the hips curl off the seat at the bottom.|Locking the knees at the top.'],
  leg_ext: ['Quads are isolated, with the rectus femoris working hardest.', 'Adjust the seat so your knees line up with the machine pivot and the pad sits on your lower shins.|Hold the handles and sit tall.|Extend your knees until your legs are almost straight.|Lower slowly under control.', 'Squeeze the quads at the top.|Move through a controlled tempo.', 'Swinging the weight up.|Lifting the hips off the seat.'],
  bss: ['Quads and glutes lead, with the hamstrings assisting, with a big balance demand.', 'Stand a few feet in front of a bench and rest the top of one foot behind you on it.|Hold dumbbells at your sides.|Lower your back knee toward the floor while keeping your torso upright.|Drive through your front foot to stand.', 'Keep most of the weight on your front leg.|A longer stance shifts work to the glutes.', 'Standing too close and pushing the knee far forward.|Leaning the torso and losing balance.'],
  front_squat: ['Quads lead, with glutes and the upper back assisting.', 'Rest the bar on your front shoulders in a rack or with crossed arms, elbows high.|Brace your core and stand with feet shoulder-width apart.|Sit straight down until your thighs are parallel or lower.|Drive up while keeping your elbows high.', 'Keep your elbows pointing forward.|Stay tall through the torso.', 'Letting the elbows drop and the bar roll forward.|Rounding the upper back.'],
