  smith_squat: ['Quads and glutes lead, with the fixed bar path giving stability.', 'Set the bar on your upper back and place your feet slightly forward of the bar.|Unrack and brace your core.|Squat down until your thighs are at least parallel.|Press up and rerack at the end.', 'Place feet forward so the knees do not travel too far.|Keep your chest up.', 'Standing with feet directly under the bar.|Using too much weight and cutting the depth.'],
