  walking_lunge: ['Quads and glutes lead, with the hamstrings assisting, and it demands balance.', 'Hold dumbbells at your sides and stand tall.|Step forward and lower your back knee toward the floor.|Push through the front foot to stand and step forward with the other leg.|Continue walking for the target reps.', 'Take long enough steps that your front shin stays near vertical.|Keep your torso upright.', 'Taking short steps that stress the knees.|Letting the front knee cave in.'],
