  sissy: ['Quads are isolated, especially the rectus femoris, with a big knee stretch.', 'Stand holding a support and rise onto the balls of your feet.|Lean your torso back while letting your knees travel forward.|Lower yourself until you feel a strong quad stretch.|Return to standing by driving the knees back.', 'Keep a straight line from knees to shoulders.|Start with a small range.', 'Doing it without control.|Going deeper than your knees tolerate.'],
