  leg_curl: ['Hamstrings are isolated.', 'Lie face down on the machine with the pad just above your heels.|Hold the handles and keep your hips pressed down.|Curl your heels toward your glutes.|Lower slowly to almost straight legs.', 'Do not lift the hips.|Squeeze at the top.', 'Swinging the weight up with momentum.|Lifting the hips off the pad.'],
  seated_curl: ['Hamstrings are isolated, with a stretched start position that works them harder.', 'Adjust the seat so your knees line up with the pivot and the pad sits above your heels.|Lock the thigh pad over your thighs.|Curl your heels down and back.|Return slowly to straight legs.', 'Keep your back against the seat.|Control the return.', 'Leaning forward to cheat.|Using partial range.'],
