  sl_rdl: ['Hamstrings and glutes on one leg, with a heavy balance demand.', 'Stand on one leg holding a dumbbell in the opposite hand.|Hinge forward while extending your free leg behind you.|Lower until your torso is near parallel to the floor.|Return to standing by driving your hips forward.', 'Keep your hips square to the floor.|Keep a soft bend in the standing knee.', 'Rotating the hips open.|Rounding the back.'],
