  cable_kickback: ['Glutes are isolated, with the hamstrings helping a little.', 'Attach an ankle strap to a low pulley and stand facing the stack.|Hold a support and keep a slight bend in the standing knee.|Kick your working leg straight back and slightly up.|Return slowly with control.', 'Keep your hips square.|Squeeze the glute at the top.', 'Arching the lower back to get the leg higher.|Swinging with momentum.'],
  hip_abd: ['Glutes, especially the glute medius, are isolated.', 'Sit on the machine with your back against the pad and the pads outside your knees.|Hold the handles and brace your core.|Press your knees apart as far as is comfortable.|Return slowly without letting the weight crash.', 'Lean slightly forward for more glute max involvement.|Control the return.', 'Using too much weight and rocking.|Cutting the range short.'],
  pull_through: ['Glutes lead, with the hamstrings assisting, with a hip hinge pattern.', 'Set a low pulley with a rope and face away from the stack, holding the rope between your legs.|Step forward and hinge at the hips with a flat back.|Drive your hips forward to stand tall, squeezing your glutes.|Return by pushing your hips back.', 'Hinge, do not squat.|Keep your arms straight.', 'Squatting the movement.|Leaning back at the top.'],
  sumo_squat: ['Glutes and inner thighs lead, with the quads working hard.', 'Stand with feet wide and toes turned out, holding a dumbbell between your legs.|Keep your chest tall.|Sit down between your legs until your thighs are parallel.|Drive up through your heels and squeeze your glutes.', 'Keep knees tracking over your toes.|Keep your torso upright.', 'Letting the knees collapse inward.|Rounding the back.'],
  sumo_dl: ['Glutes, quads and hamstrings lead, with the back and grip assisting.', 'Stand with feet wide and toes turned out, bar over mid-foot.|Hinge down and grip the bar inside your knees with a flat back.|Push the floor away and stand tall, keeping the bar close.|Lower the bar under control.', 'Push your knees out over your toes.|Keep your chest up.', 'Rounding the lower back.|Letting the hips shoot up before the bar moves.'],
  // ---- calves ----
  calf: ['Calves (gastrocnemius) are isolated, with the straight-knee position emphasising the upper calf.', 'Stand on the machine platform with the balls of your feet on the edge and shoulders under the pads.|Lower your heels as far as you comfortably can.|Press up onto your toes as high as possible.|Hold at the top, then lower slowly.', 'Pause at the stretch and at the top.|Keep your knees straight but not locked.', 'Bouncing at the bottom.|Using a short range.'],
  seated_calf: ['Calves (soleus) are emphasised, because the knee is bent.', 'Sit at the machine with the pad on your lower thighs and the balls of your feet on the platform.|Lower your heels for a deep stretch.|Press up onto your toes.|Hold briefly and lower slowly.', 'Pause at the bottom.|Keep your knees fixed.', 'Bouncing through the reps.|Using a short range.'],
  lp_calf: ['Calves are isolated, using the leg press as the loading machine.', 'Sit in the leg press and place the balls of your feet on the bottom edge of the platform.|Press the platform to straighten your legs without locking the knees.|Lower your heels for a deep stretch, then push up onto your toes.|Return slowly.', 'Keep your knees almost straight.|Use a full range.', 'Letting the platform slip off the feet.|Bending the knees to cheat.'],
